<title>AUSTRIA: Indonesian oil minister arrives for Weds OPEC meet.</title>
<headline>Indonesian oil minister arrives for Weds OPEC meet.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian oil minister Ida Bagus Sudjana arrived here on Tuesday for OPEC's full ministerial meeting due to begin on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The minister was not available to answer reporters' questions.</p>
<p>No time has yet been scheduled for Wednesday's meeting.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
